          1*       <136> ECHO                                                      OP1[  IS_CONST (268435443) '%3Cdiv+class%3D%22body_padded%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ch1%3EHelp+-+SQL+Injection+%28Blind%29%3C%2Fh1%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctable+width%3D%27100%25%27+bgcolor%3D%27white%27+style%3D%22border%3A2px+%23C0C0C0+solid%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctr%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctd%3E%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EAbout%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EWhen+an+attacker+executes+SQL+injection+attacks%2C+sometimes+the+server+responds+with+error+messages+from+the+database+server+complaining+that+the+SQL+query%27s+syntax+is+incorrect.%0D%0A%09%09%09Blind+SQL+injection+is+identical+to+normal+SQL+Injection+except+that+when+an+attacker+attempts+to+exploit+an+application%2C+rather+then+getting+a+useful+error+message%2C%0D%0A%09%09%09they+get+a+generic+page+specified+by+the+developer+instead.+This+makes+exploiting+a+potential+SQL+Injection+attack+more+difficult+but+not+impossible.%0D%0A%09%09%09An+attacker+can+still+steal+data+by+asking+a+series+of+True+and+False+questions+through+SQL+statements%2C+and+monitoring+how+the+web+application+response%0D%0A%09%09%09%28valid+entry+retunred+or+404+header+set%29.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3E%22time+based%22+injection+method+is+often+used+when+there+is+no+visible+feedback+in+how+the+page+different+in+its+response+%28hence+its+a+blind+attack%29.%0D%0A%09%09+%09This+means+the+attacker+will+wait+to+see+how+long+the+page+takes+to+response+back.+If+it+takes+longer+than+normal%2C+their+query+was+successful.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EObjective%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EFind+the+version+of+the+SQL+database+software+through+a+blind+SQL+attack.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3ELow+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+SQL+query+uses+RAW+input+that+is+directly+controlled+by+the+attacker.+All+they+need+to-do+is+escape+the+query+and+then+they+are+able%0D%0A%09%09%09to+execute+any+SQL+query+they+wish.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3E%3Fid%3D1%27+AND+sleep+5%26Submit%3DSubmit%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EMedium+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+medium+level+uses+a+form+of+SQL+injection+protection%2C+with+the+function+of%0D%0A%09%09%09%22' ]
